ract-backed data table, and each contract list response contains at least one record.\",\n      \"when\": \"The API starts and its contract list operations are called.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A fresh App database has `Seed:Demo` set to false and the test fixture creates only its own records through contract operations.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-6.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"Each response contains only the test-created records and no demo row is required by the test.\",\n      \"when\": \"The test calls contract list operations without starting demo seeding.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"anchors\": [\n     {\n      \"lineEnd\": 9,\n      \"lineStart\": 7,\n      \"path\": \"App.Api/SeedData.cs\",\n      \"quote\": \"    public static void Run(AppDb db)\\n    {\\n    }\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"lineEnd\": 25,\n      \"lineStart\": 23,\n      \"path\": \"App.Api/Program.cs\",\n      \"quote\": \"// sample rows, only when asked for (Seed__Demo=true): tests and the factory's own checks start on an empty database\\n        if (app.Configuration.GetValue<bool>(\\\"Seed:Demo\\\")) SeedData.Run(db);\\n    }\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"lineEnd\": 7,\n      \"lineStart\": 5,\n      \"path\": \"App.Api/AppDb.cs\",\n      \"quote\": \"public class AppDb(DbContextOptions<AppDb> options) : DbContext(options)\\n{\\n}\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Feedlot Operations API shall execute `SeedData.Run` only when `Seed:Demo` is true and, on that run, populate every contract-backed data table with at least two believable rows derived from contract examples.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-6\",\n    \"op\": \"MODIFIED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-4\",\n     \"Q-2\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The API is running in this repository.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-7.1\",\n      \"level\": \"manual\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows API documentation or health information only and no feedlot produc