api/v1/inventory/projections\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.3\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the wastageRatio, daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, sixMonth, and annual projection fields and stock movements\",\n      \"when\": \"Inventory and feeding records exist\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"An authenticated client calls GET /api/v1/rations\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.4\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response list includes ingredient entered units, normalized quantities, proportions, and cost fields\",\n      \"when\": \"Saved rations exist\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"An authenticated client submits a valid ration with ingredients expressed in tons\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.5\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the returned ration retains each enteredUnit and includes the corresponding normalizedQuantityLb and calculated costUsdPerLb fields\",\n      \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"An authenticated client submits valid nutrition or animal-range constraints\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.6\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response candidates contain ingredient proportions, cost, nutrition values, tradeoff, and Candidate status\",\n      \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/optimization\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"An authenticated client explicitly accepts an existing candidate\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.7\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the requested candidateId and its Saved or Assigned status\",\n      \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/candidates/{candidateId}/save and POST /api/v1/rations/candidates/{candidateId}/assign\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"An 